{"id":47427,"ord":139,"n_segments":152,"prev":47426,"next":47428,"doc":{"id":"61125","title":"61125_Teddy Bunn oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Theodore Leroy Bunn","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/61125/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=61125"},"chapter":"Edgar Hayes, reflections and closing","title":"Jimmy Bunn the pianist","category":"person_portrait","summary":"Pianist Jimmy Bunn and his Japanese wife helped Rosenberg find Bunn; Jimmy kicked a heroin habit while staying with Bunn in San Francisco.","period":"1970s","year_from":1970,"year_to":1979,"words":165,"start":[276,15],"end":[278,2],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=61125#s47427","tags":{"places":[{"name":"San Francisco","focus":0,"type":"city"},{"name":"Los Angeles","focus":0,"type":"city"}],"venues":[],"bands":[]},"people":[{"name":"Jimmy Bunn","qid":null,"n":4},{"name":"Japanese woman","qid":null,"n":2},{"name":"Sharon","qid":null,"n":1},{"name":"Barney Kessel","qid":"Q498745","n":1}],"story":{"theme":27,"theme_name":"Drink, drugs and the bandstand's casualties","community":51,"community_name":"Drugs and drink on the bandstand and the road","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":276,"b":15,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Downtown here. In L.A. Yeah. You heard of Jimmy Bunn?"},{"p":276,"b":16,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah. I've never heard him play, but --"},{"p":276,"b":17,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":276,"b":18,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"He plays piano, right?"},{"p":276,"b":19,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":276,"b":20,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"How old is he, about 50?"},{"p":277,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. He was just 50. You hit it. He's working up north."},{"p":277,"b":1,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah. It was actually through his wife that I got your phone number originally."},{"p":277,"b":2,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"A Japanese woman."},{"p":277,"b":3,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah."},{"p":277,"b":4,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":277,"b":5,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Barney Kessel gave me Jimmy's number."},{"p":277,"b":6,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":277,"b":7,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And then Jimmy wasn't home and I spoke to his wife."},{"p":277,"b":8,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":277,"b":9,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Japanese woman."},{"p":277,"b":10,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":277,"b":11,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And she was very helpful."},{"p":277,"b":12,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Uh-huh. She always is."},{"p":277,"b":13,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"They're beautiful kids, too."},{"p":277,"b":14,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Ain't they beautiful?"},{"p":277,"b":15,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah. I saw them -- Skip -- no, Sharon showed me a picture."},{"p":277,"b":16,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Uh-huh. Yeah, Jimmy was on that heavy stuff. You didn't know that, did you?"},{"p":277,"b":17,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"No."},{"p":277,"b":18,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He was on it. It took him a long time"},{"p":278,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"to kick it, but he was on it. He kicked it --"},{"p":278,"b":1,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"He's straight now, though."},{"p":278,"b":2,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. He was with me when he kicked it. Up in Frisco."}]}